{#
    Taking part (owner: workstream B, docs/features/events-page/detail-pages.md "The rest of the page"): the header's
    "✓ You're going!" links here (#taking-part). _event_attendance.html.twig unchanged - "I'm going" with Change/Leave,
    or the registration card (id="registration", the header's "Registration" links to it) - plus "Add my time" on the
    event page while the header does not show it. Only on a publicly visible page - joining needs one (README P17), so
    a draft, pending or rejected event offers nobody "I'm going". Variables: the page's event, attendance, can_add_time,
    event_title, timeline, is_publicly_visible; series (edition page only)

    Partner finder (docs/features/partner-finder.md "Part B"): "Find a partner (N)" in the row, the partner card under
    it - both only while the event has a finder (partner_finder, PartnerFinderCardResolver - null everywhere else).

    A participant of an online event with online timing (docs/features/online-competitions/README.md §5.4) also gets
    "Open my competition page" - their personal link (attendance.onlineToken, GetEventAttendance), opened as a full page
    load: the participant page lives without Turbo.
#}
{% if is_publicly_visible %}
<section class="ev-detail-section ev-taking-part" id="taking-part" aria-labelledby="taking-part-title">
    <h2 class="ev-detail-section-title" id="taking-part-title">{{ 'event_rounds.taking_part'|trans }}</h2>
    <div class="ev-taking-part-body">
        {% if attendance.onlineToken is not null %}
            <a href="{{ online_link_url(attendance.onlineToken) }}" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary text-wrap" data-turbo="false" data-online-competition-page>
                <i class="bi bi-phone me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ 'online_rounds.links.open_my_page'|trans }}
            </a>
        {% endif %}
        {{ include('_event_attendance.html.twig', {competition_id: event.id, attendance: attendance}) }}
        {{ include('event_parts/_partner_finder_button.html.twig', {partner_finder: partner_finder|default(null)}) }}
        {#- Once: the header has it when the event is over or has no rounds (_event_header_actions.html.twig) -#}
        {% if can_add_time and (series ?? null) is null and not (event_title.isPast or not timeline.hasRounds) %}
            <a href="{{ path('puzzle_add', {competition: event.id}) }}" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary text-wrap">
                <i class="bi bi-stopwatch me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ 'events.add_my_time'|trans }}
            </a>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
    {{ include('event_parts/_partner_card.html.twig', {partner_finder: partner_finder|default(null)}) }}
</section>
{% endif %}
